#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:127
msgid ""
" - All communications are encrypted using the AES-256-CBC algorithm with a "
"randomly generated Initialisation Vector to ensure their confidentiality ; "
"it is recommended to use a strong, randomly generated Action Encryption Key "
"(the same value on all the connected websites)."
msgstr ""
" -使用随机生成的初始化矢量，使用AES-256-"
"CBC算法对所有通信进行加密，以确保其机密性；建议使用随机生成的功能强大的操作加密密钥（在所有连接的网站上均使用相同的值）。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:130
msgid ""
" - All communications are signed with a hash using the SHA256 algorithm to "
"ensure their integrity ; it is recommended to use a strong, randomly "
"generated Action Signature Key (the same value on all the connected websites)"
"."
msgstr ""
" -所有通信均使用SHA256算法以散列进行签名，以确保其完整性；建议使用随机生成的功能强大的操作签名密钥（在所有连接的网站上均使用相同的值）。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:133
msgid ""
" - All communications rely on an authentication token (randomly generated). "
"Asynchronous actions (Login & Logout by default) use a single-use token "
"(true nonce), and synchronous actions use a token valid only for a limited "
"period of time  ; it is recommended to keep the Action Token Validity "
"Duration relatively short (default is 1,800 seconds or 30 minutes, and must "
"be the same duration on all the connected websites). "
msgstr ""
" -"
"所有通信都依赖于身份验证令牌（随机生成）。异步操作（默认为登录和注销）使用一次性令牌（真正的随机数），而同步操作使用仅在有限时间段内有效的令牌；建议将操作令牌有效期限保持相对较短（默认值为1800秒或30分钟，并且在所有连接的网站上的期限必须相同）。"
" "

#. %s is the error code
#: inc/api/class-wprus-api-abstract.php:759
#, php-format
msgid " - code: %s - "
msgstr " - code: %s - "

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:44
msgid ""
" - Does not fire an action of its own per se ; this action determines "
"whether roles should be synchronised or ignored during Create and Update "
"actions, depending on specified transferred outgoing and accepted incoming "
"roles."
msgstr " -本身不采取行动;此操作确定在创建和更新操作期间应同步还是忽略角色，具体取决于指定的已转移传出角色和接受的传入角色。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:30
msgid ""
" - Fired when a user is created. The expected result is a synchronised user "
"created on all registered remote sites accepting incoming Create actions "
"(see Password, Roles and Metadata below for caveats)."
msgstr ""
" -创建用户时触发。预期结果是在所有接受注册的远程站点上创建的同步用户上，该用户接受传入的创建操作（有关警告，请参见下面的密码、角色和元数据）。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:37
msgid ""
" - Fired when a user is deleted. The expected result is the user being "
"deleted on all registered remote sites accepting incoming Delete actions."
msgstr " -删除用户时触发。预期结果是在接受传入的删除操作的所有注册远程站点上删除用户。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:33
msgid ""
" - Fired when a user is updated, either by the user themselves or another "
"user. The expected result is up to date and synchronised user information on "
"all registered remote sites accepting incoming Update actions (see Password, "
"Roles and Metadata below for caveats)."
msgstr ""
" -"
"由用户自己或另一个用户更新用户时触发。预期结果是最新的，并且在接受传入的更新操作的所有已注册远程站点上同步了用户信息（有关警告，请参阅下面的密码、角色和元数据）。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:22
msgid ""
" - Fired when a user logs in. The expected result is a user logged in on all "
"registered remote sites accepting incoming Login actions."
msgstr " -当用户登录时触发。预期结果是用户在所有接受远程登录操作的注册远程站点上登录。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:26
msgid ""
" - Fired when a user logs out. The expected result is a user logged out on "
"all registered remote sites accepting incoming Logout actions."
msgstr " -用户注销时触发。预期结果是用户在所有注册的远程站点上注销，接受传入的注销操作。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:40
msgid ""
" - Fired when a user resets their password. The expected result is the "
"password being reset for the user on all registered remote sites accepting "
"incoming Password actions."
msgstr " -当用户重置密码时触发。预期结果是在所有接受传入密码操作的注册远程站点上为用户重置密码。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:49
msgid ""
" - Fired when one or several user metadata are added / created / deleted, "
"depending on specified transferred outgoing and accepted incoming metadata "
"keys."
msgstr " -根据指定的传输传出和接受的传入元数据密钥，添加/创建/删除一个或多个用户元数据时触发。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:136
msgid ""
" - IP addresses are verified using the REMOTE_ADDR server environment "
"variable, which cannot be faked (unless the servers or the network "
"infrastructure are already highly compromised, in which case there are "
"bigger issues to worry about)."
msgstr ""
" -"
"使用REMOTE_ADDR服务器环境变量验证了IP地址，该环境变量不能被伪造（除非服务器或网络基础结构已经受到严重破坏，在这种情况下，您需要担心更大的问题）。"

