#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:170
msgid ""
"Asynchronous actions (Login & Logout by default) are the most costly: the "
"operations themselves are not blocking, but their Action Tokens have to be "
"renewed beforehand each time: true nonces, single-use tokens, are necessary "
"for security reasons when firing actions from the browser."
msgstr ""
"异步操作（默认情况下为“登录”和“注销”）代价最高：操作本身并未阻塞，但是每次都必须事先更新其操作令牌：出于安全原因，在浏览器触发操作时必须使用真正的随机数、一次性令牌。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:171
msgid ""
"Asynchronous actions are also potentially more susceptible to failure in "
"case of network issues, such as if the page load is interrupted or the "
"enqueued script call failed in the browser ; this is a necessary trade-off "
"as these actions require authentication cookie manipulations."
msgstr ""
"如果出现网络问题，例如页面加载中断或浏览器中的排队脚本调用失败，异步操作也很可能会导致失败。这是必要的权衡，因为这些操作需要身份验证Cookie的操作。"

#: inc/class-wprus-settings.php:271
msgid "Authentication & Encryption"
msgstr "身份验证和加密"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:133
msgid "Authentication tokens"
msgstr "认证令牌"

#: inc/templates/admin/browser-support-metabox.php:11
msgid ""
"Because Safari and browsers on iOS devices do not allow cross-domain cookie "
"manipulation by default for privacy reasons, Login User Action in these "
"browsers is done with explicit redirections, and Logout User Action logs out "
"the user in all browsers."
msgstr ""
"出于隐私原因，Safari 和 iOS 设备上的浏览器默认不允许跨域 Cookie "
"操作，因此这些浏览器中的“登录”用户操作通过明确重定向完成，而“注销”用户操作会让用户在所有浏览器中注销。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:88
msgid ""
"Because these browsers prevent cross-domain third-party cookie manipulation "
"by default, explicit redirections to log in users and destroying all the "
"user sessions when logging out are necessary. With this method, only first-"
"party cookies are manipulated. This is akin to logging in Youtube with a "
"Google account."
msgstr ""
"由于这些浏览器默认阻止跨域第三方 Cookie 操作，因此必须通过明确重定向让用户登录，并在注销时销毁所有用户会话。此方法仅操作第一方 "
"Cookie，类似于使用 Google 帐号登录 YouTube。"

