msgstr "网站的连接越多，对性能的负面影响就越大。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:23
msgid ""
"The page needs to load without interruption and the network between the user "
"and the remote sites be accessible for it to take effect, because this "
"operation relies on browser cookies (the action is fired by a script "
"asynchronously in the footer of the page after login)."
msgstr ""
"该页面需要不间断地加载，并且可以访问用户和远程站点之间的网络才能使其生效，因为此操作依赖于浏览器Cookie（此操作由登录后页面页脚中的脚本异步触发） 。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:27
msgid ""
"The page needs to load without interruption and the network between the user "
"and the remote sites be accessible for it to take effect, because this "
"operation relies on browser cookies (the action is fired by a script "
"asynchronously in the footer of the page after logout)."
msgstr ""
"该页面需要不间断地加载，并且可以访问用户和远程站点之间的网络才能使其生效，因为此操作依赖于浏览器cookie（注销后页面脚注中的脚本会异步触发该操作） 。"

#: inc/class-wprus-settings.php:190
msgid ""
"The Remote Site address must start with \"http\".\n"
