#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:66
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The URLs used in settings of WP Remote Users Sync %1$s match the URL in your "
"WordPress settings: the protocol (%2$s vs. %3$s) and the subdomain (www vs. "
"non-www) must be the same across the board. It is also worth checking the "
"%4$s option in the %5$s table of the WordPress databases, because in some "
"cases the content of Settings > General > WordPress Address (URL) gets "
"abusively overwritten by plugins or themes."
msgstr ""
"WP Remote Users Sync 设置中使用的 URL 必须与 WordPress 设置中的 URL %1$s匹配：协议（%2$s 与 "
"%3$s）和子域名（www 与非 www）必须完全相同。还应检查 WordPress 数据库中 %5$s 表内的 %4$s "
"选项，因为在某些情况下，插件或主题会错误地覆盖“设置 > 常规 > WordPress 地址（URL）”的内容。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:311
msgid "the WordPress support forum"
msgstr "WordPress支持论坛"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:182
msgid ""
"The worse the connection between the remote sites is, the bigger the "
"relatively negative impact on performances."
msgstr "远程站点之间的连接越差，对性能的相对负面影响就越大。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:15
msgid ""
"There is no \"Master Website\": each site is working independently, firing "
"and receiving actions depending on each site's configuration."
msgstr "没有“主网站”：每个站点都在独立工作，并根据每个站点的配置触发和接收操作。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:41
msgid ""
"This action also determines whether the passwords are synchronised or should "
"be ignored during Create and Update actions."
msgstr "此操作还确定在创建和更新操作期间密码是同步的还是应忽略。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:50
msgid ""
"This action is particularly useful to synchronise user data added by plugins "
"(such as address information in WooCommerce)."
msgstr "此操作对于同步插件添加的用户数据（例如WooCommerce中的地址信息）特别有用。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:265
msgid ""
"This means that two websites in localhost (behind virtual hosts, for example)"
" can communicate. However, if one of the websites is on localhost and the "
"other is not, token exchange cannot happen and the websites will not be able "
"to communicate."
msgstr ""
"这意味着localhost中的两个网站（例如，在虚拟主机后面）可以通信。但是，如果其中一个网站位于本地主机上，而另一个不在本地主机上，则无法进行令牌交换，并且这些网站将无法通信。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:152
msgid ""
"This means the impact on performances depends on the response time between "
"the connected websites."
msgstr "这意味着对性能的影响取决于所连接网站之间的响应时间。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:236
