#. Name of the plugin
#: inc/class-wprus-settings.php:136
#: inc/templates/admin/main-settings-page.php:9
msgid "WP Remote Users Sync"
msgstr "WP远程用户同步"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:14
msgid ""
"WP Remote Users Sync \"listens\" to changes related to WordPress users, and "
"fires outgoing \"actions\" to registered remote sites. The registered remote "
"sites with WP Remote Users Sync installed then catch incoming actions and "
"react accordingly."
msgstr ""
"WP Remote Users Sync“侦听”与WordPress用户相关的更改，并将传出的“操作”触发到已注册的远程站点。安装了WP Remote "
"Users Sync的注册远程站点然后捕获传入的操作并做出相应的反应。"

#: inc/class-wprus-settings.php:122
msgid "WP Remote Users Sync is not ready. "
msgstr "WP远程用户同步尚未准备好。 "

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:151
msgid ""
"WP Remote Users Sync needs to communicate with the remote sites to actually "
"synchronise users."
msgstr "WP Remote Users Sync需要与远程站点进行通信以实际同步用户。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:273
msgid "WP Remote Users Sync provides its own user import/export tool."
msgstr "WP Remote Users Sync 提供了自己的用户导入和导出工具。"

#: inc/templates/admin/help.php:264
msgid ""
"Yes - as long as the websites can reach each other, WP Remote User Sync will "
"work."
msgstr "是的-只要两个网站可以互相访问，WP Remote User Sync就可以使用。"
